                                "sense_id": "c8600129-b082-31eb-82fa-9a52ea427b4d",
                                "text": "Ik kan niet eten vanwege deze vreselijke tandpijn.",
                                "translation": "I can't eat because of this terrible toothache.",
                                "english": "I can't eat because of this terrible toothache."
                            },
                            {
